flowchart TD
    A[GameProfile + user locks] --> B[Fresh hardware/display context]
    B --> C[Load release-owned game optimization knowledge]
    C --> D[Resolve hard constraints]
    D --> E[Preserve valid LOCKED fields]
    E --> F[Build static recommendation]
    F --> G[Validate through Game Configuration Adapter]
    G --> H{AUTO?}
    H -- No / Suggest only --> I[Show recommendation]
    H -- Yes --> J[Apply while game not running]
    J --> K[Read-back verify]
    K --> L[Managed launch]
    L --> M[GAME_RUNNING confirmed]
    M --> N{Telemetry available?}
    N -- No --> O[Keep static recommendation]
    N -- Yes --> P[Collect valid representative observation]
    P --> Q{Target satisfied?}
    Q -- Yes with margin --> R[Consider quality upgrade ladder]
    Q -- Yes --> O
    Q -- No --> S[Use degradation ladder skipping user locks]
    S --> T{Feasible candidate remains?}
    T -- Yes --> U[Create refined recommendation for next launch / explicit Optimize]
    T -- No --> V[TARGET_UNMET with locks or hardware limit]
    R --> U
    U --> W[Do not mutate normal gameplay by default]
